In the evening, I came to the Lonavala railway station.
I boarded the train towards Mumbai.
The train came down from the mountain.
I sat in my own seat.
I looked outside from the window.
It was completely dark outside.
A woman was sitting near me.
Her bag was large.
But my own bag was small.
Late at night, the train reached Mumbai.
I came out of the station.
Then I went to my home by bus.
My home was very quiet.
Today I walked a lot on the mountain.
Therefore, my legs were very tired.
But my mind was very happy.
I felt a new energy.
Now it was eleven o'clock at night.
I went to sleep on the bed.
I am ready for the coming week.
